Parts of Spikes/ are adapted from Phosphene
  https://github.com/kageroumado/phosphene  (commit 8b5bd57, 2026-09-03)

Adapted files and what was taken:
  Extension/BridgingHeader.h    the private protocol and CAContext declarations
  Extension/PrivateBridge.swift remote-context and snapshot object construction,
                                the Codable shims for the settings view models and
                                the archive/unarchive class remap
  Extension/ExtensionConfig.swift  the NSXPCInterface class whitelist
  Extension/XPCHandler.swift    request field extraction by Mirror
  Extension/SurfaceStore.swift  one CAContext per WallpaperID, context reuse across
                                connection drops, teardown after a grace period
  Shared/LoopEngine.swift       two-reader gapless loop with a timestamp offset
  Shared/SurfaceLayers.swift    _setDisallowsVideoLayerDisplayCompositing:

No GPL project was read for this work.

